LEVEL res://core_v2/scenes/PropStage.tscn
LOAD_PROP res://core_v2/props/ElevatorProp.tscn
WAIT 1.0
SCREENSHOT 0_idle

# Simulate input signal on Input_Floor1 (child of Prop)
# Note: Since there's no OLCS wiring in this isolated test, we can try calling the controller method directly OR interact with the internal button.

# 1. Interact with internal button (it is a child of the prop)
INTERACT Platform/Button_Internal
WAIT 2.0
SCREENSHOT 1_active

# 2. Reset (PropStage reload?) or try another floor via script call?
# Let's try calling _on_floor_request directly to simulate external input
# CALL _on_floor_request 1
# CALL _on_floor_request(1)
# OYS syntax for CALL is: CALL Method Arg1 Arg2
CALL _on_floor_request 1
WAIT 5.0
SCREENSHOT 2_moved
